1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 9]</font>

3
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:47,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, cheers.</font>

4
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:52,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're something.</font>

5
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:53,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your wife's not home, is she?</font>

6
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, you wouldn't dare</font>

7
00:02:55,430 --> 00:02:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drink on the sly like this.</font>

8
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a big gulp.</font>

9
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's home.</font>

10
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She heard</font>

11
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:01,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you wanted a drink with me,</font>

12
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:03,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she agreed.</font>

13
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:04,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks. Thanks.</font>

14
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, tell me, buddy.</font>

15
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:08,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you need me for?</font>

16
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few days ago, Shen from the police</font>

17
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asked us to help investigate Dongle.</font>

18
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:14,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggested we start</font>

19
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by checking the land-use designation.</font>

20
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

21
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now,</font>

22
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:23,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a snag.</font>

23
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu suspects Dongle and Aike</font>

24
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of smuggling tobacco and alcohol.</font>

25
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He followed the trail</font>

26
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:32,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and found tax problems at Dongle.</font>

27
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know how he is.</font>

28
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he sinks his teeth into this,</font>

29
00:03:36,430 --> 00:03:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be left in a very passive position.</font>

30
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao, we're both veteran tax officers.</font>

31
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these years,</font>

32
00:03:51,310 --> 00:03:52,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we've spent more time together</font>

33
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than with our wives and kids.</font>

34
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With you,</font>

35
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never held anything back.</font>

36
00:03:58,150 --> 00:03:59,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In investigating Dongle,</font>

37
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do have some selfish motives.</font>

38
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we delay it for now?</font>

39
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can do a full investigation</font>

40
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until the national
and local tax split is done.</font>

41
00:04:08,590 --> 00:04:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The new local tax bureau
is being set up.</font>

42
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need a shining achievement.</font>

43
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's credit that achievement
to the new setup.</font>

44
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know
what your prized student is like.</font>

45
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's already caught the scent at Dongle.</font>

46
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to delay?</font>

47
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me how.</font>

48
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

49
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That kid might trample
all over your good intentions.</font>

50
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think I'm being a bit factional?</font>

51
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

52
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:36,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These past few years,
our Inspection Unit</font>

53
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has indeed been keeping an eye</font>

54
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on Dongle's tax issues.</font>

55
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle's background is very complicated.</font>

56
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:44,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many provincial and city leaders</font>

57
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">also value</font>

58
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this so-called star enterprise
of Chunjiang.</font>

59
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Buddy, I get</font>

60
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your concerns.</font>

61
00:04:50,870 --> 00:04:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, it's not just a concern.</font>

62
00:04:52,830 --> 00:04:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a question of tactics
and how to fight it.</font>

63
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, I don't want
to start investigating them now.</font>

64
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:59,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, it's not just</font>

65
00:04:59,390 --> 00:05:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a matter of selfish motives.</font>

66
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:04,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I always feel
that the problems Dongle is hiding</font>

67
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could be the biggest tax-related case</font>

68
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we've ever found.</font>

69
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you want to fire a warning shot,</font>

70
00:05:12,630 --> 00:05:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you still need to pick the right moment.</font>

71
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:15,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The situation isn't clear yet.</font>

72
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't just charge in recklessly</font>

73
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on pure passion.</font>

74
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:22,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could end up losing everything.</font>

75
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, here's what I'm thinking.</font>

76
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to win a clean,
satisfying victory</font>

77
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the local tax brothers.</font>

78
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at Haiyang.</font>

79
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's suddenly doing well.</font>

80
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should be happy for him.</font>

81
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this meal</font>

82
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">left me full in my stomach</font>

83
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet empty in my heart.</font>

84
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, he paid us back the money</font>

85
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:49,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even bought us shoes.</font>

86
00:05:50,950 --> 00:05:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It feels a bit distant.</font>

87
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been thinking.</font>

88
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does he actually want us
to investigate Dongle</font>

89
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or not?</font>

90
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to help us.</font>

91
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just pretend I never gave you this.</font>

92
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

93
00:06:09,310 --> 00:06:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this something you can handle?</font>

94
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle's background is very complicated.
The waters run deep.</font>

95
00:06:14,870 --> 00:06:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not someone
we can afford to provoke.</font>

96
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was so hard for me
to stay in Chunjiang</font>

97
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:22,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and find this job.</font>

98
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pay is so good.</font>

99
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I help you</font>

100
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and lose my job,</font>

101
00:06:26,750 --> 00:06:27,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who's responsible?</font>

102
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, if I cause you trouble later,</font>

103
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sorry in advance.</font>

104
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There will definitely be trouble.</font>

105
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I lose my job, I don't care.</font>

106
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just cling to you and never leave.</font>

107
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll have to take care of me
for the rest of my life.</font>

108
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel this meal was carefully designed.</font>

109
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I keep feeling there's something</font>

110
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:42,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">behind his words.</font>

111
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have that feeling too.</font>

112
00:06:46,950 --> 00:06:48,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But during this meal,</font>

113
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was still very eager to help us.</font>

114
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he provided information.</font>

115
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The information from him is the same</font>

116
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as that from Ms. Tang.</font>

117
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:00,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

118
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The more I think about it,
the more wrong it feels.</font>

119
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:06,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's what I think: Is it because</font>

120
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your master knows Dongle inside out</font>

121
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he's been trying so hard to stop you
from investigating Dongle?</font>

122
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what Ms. Tang said</font>

123
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is getting more and more interesting.</font>

124
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you said is pretty interesting too.</font>

125
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think my master...</font>

126
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You shouldn't blindly worship anyone.</font>

127
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think rationally for yourself.</font>

128
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here with me,</font>

129
00:07:31,070 --> 00:07:32,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're under semi-military management.</font>

130
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet you don't follow orders.</font>

131
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you keep working?</font>

132
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

133
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:38,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stop all work.</font>

134
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:39,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Full-time training.</font>

135
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare to investigate again,</font>

136
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't work in tax anymore.</font>

137
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, fear isn't an option.</font>

138
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If even I back down,</font>

139
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these people will only get more brazen.</font>

140
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'm afraid.</font>

141
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm backing down, okay?</font>

142
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that okay?</font>

143
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang
must know Dongle's tax amount</font>

144
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't match
the scale of their business.</font>

145
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle's background is very complicated.</font>

146
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The waters run deep.</font>

147
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare to investigate again,</font>

148
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't work in tax anymore.</font>

149
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's what I think:</font>

150
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it because your master</font>

151
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knows Dongle inside out</font>

152
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he's been trying so hard
to stop you from investigating Dongle?</font>

153
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A lot of tax-related crimes</font>

154
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could mean collusion inside and out.</font>

155
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How well do you know your master?</font>

156
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me the truth.</font>

157
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's like my own father.</font>

158
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a man who has devoted</font>

159
00:08:24,070 --> 00:08:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">half his life to tax work.</font>

160
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I caught</font>

161
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what Ms. Tang said just now.</font>

162
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me repeat the key point for you.</font>

163
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tax crimes mean
collusion inside and out.</font>

164
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It depends
on whether you dare to investigate.</font>

165
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to think carefully</font>

166
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about why he suspended you from work</font>

167
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and made you study here.</font>

168
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:44,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop it.</font>

169
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just speculation.</font>

170
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no evidence.</font>

171
00:08:47,030 --> 00:08:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't blindly worship anyone.</font>

172
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most important thing now</font>

173
00:08:50,790 --> 00:08:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not just whether you want
to investigate.</font>

174
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's whether you dare to investigate.</font>

175
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still young.</font>

176
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't do things you'll regret.</font>

177
00:09:17,870 --> 00:09:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, handsome, what's your name?</font>

178
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

179
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

180
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Cantonese is so authentic.</font>

181
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you from?</font>

182
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hong Kong, China.</font>

183
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does this taste make you nostalgic?</font>

184
00:09:30,870 --> 00:09:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

185
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Changfen diner</font>

186
00:09:34,870 --> 00:09:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is very famous here.</font>

187
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao.</font>

188
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're back.</font>

189
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are still customers this late?</font>

190
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're back.</font>

191
00:09:43,150 --> 00:09:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, let me introduce you.</font>

192
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:45,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son, Changfen An.</font>

193
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

194
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

195
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want something to eat?</font>

196
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll cook for you.</font>

197
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need, it's too late.</font>

198
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back and rest early.</font>

199
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:57,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave this place to me.</font>

200
00:09:57,870 --> 00:09:59,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why so filial all of a sudden?</font>

201
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

202
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll head off first.</font>

203
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:02,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't charged him yet.</font>

204
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember to collect the money later.</font>

205
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

206
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving now.</font>

207
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

208
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, turn off the stove.</font>

209
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye-bye.</font>

210
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Changfen is delicious.</font>

211
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you:
Stay away from my family.</font>

212
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Chunjiang, not Hong Kong, China.</font>

213
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't mean that.</font>

214
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police do their job.</font>

215
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We do ours.</font>

216
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's keep a safe distance,</font>

217
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with proper boundaries.</font>

218
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just don't overdo it.</font>

219
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:02,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, your mom runs a Changfen diner.</font>

220
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She raised you penny by penny.</font>

221
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't easy.</font>

222
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly are you trying to do?</font>

223
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not trying to do anything.</font>

224
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to say
life isn't easy for anyone.</font>

225
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cherish it.</font>

226
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:23,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep the change.</font>

227
00:11:25,270 --> 00:11:25,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good night.</font>

228
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

229
00:12:16,910 --> 00:12:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want to eat? Order anything.</font>

230
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Never mind. I'll do it.</font>

231
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like usual, two steaks.</font>

232
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay. Thank you.
- Thank you.</font>

233
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've ordered?</font>

234
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

235
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't usually eat
Western food, do you?</font>

236
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

237
00:12:36,910 --> 00:12:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is my first time
eating Western food.</font>

238
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about you? Do you come here often?</font>

239
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:44,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is under the Dongle Group.
It's my cafeteria.</font>

240
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you usually eat at home?</font>

241
00:12:47,550 --> 00:12:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no one at home to cook.</font>

242
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always eat out.</font>

243
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then where do you eat
during Chinese New Year?</font>

244
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I go back to the ancestral hall.</font>

245
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The whole village eats together.</font>

246
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does your mom go there too?</font>

247
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom? My dad is dead.</font>

248
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has no right to eat there.
She's not a Lin.</font>

249
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

250
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:07,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard from the manager</font>

251
00:13:08,390 --> 00:13:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Ruyi is treating someone
to a meal here.</font>

252
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to see who it is.</font>

253
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:15,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Zhou,
don't you have work this afternoon?</font>

254
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swapped shifts with someone.</font>

255
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, please have a seat.</font>

256
00:13:20,630 --> 00:13:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I sit, Ruyi?</font>

257
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, can she sit?</font>

258
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, Ahong.</font>

259
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then sit down.</font>

260
00:13:28,630 --> 00:13:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, sit.</font>

261
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

262
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, what would you like to eat?</font>

263
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already eaten.</font>

264
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open a bottle of wine for me.</font>

265
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

266
00:13:53,150 --> 00:13:54,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such good red wine.</font>

267
00:13:55,030 --> 00:13:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's raise a glass.</font>

268
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To...</font>

269
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To what?</font>

270
00:14:03,150 --> 00:14:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To the deep and forever love</font>

271
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between Haiyang and me.</font>

272
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang, my new boyfriend.</font>

273
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang is one of us at Dongle.</font>

274
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's one of Tianbao's men too.</font>

275
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's steady and capable.</font>

276
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Much better than those nobodies</font>

277
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you used to bring home.</font>

278
00:14:37,030 --> 00:14:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, Ruyi is great in every way.</font>

279
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She just doesn't stick with things.</font>

280
00:14:41,670 --> 00:14:44,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she gets tired of you one day
and dumps you,</font>

281
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't come crying.</font>

282
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

283
00:14:48,910 --> 00:14:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

284
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:50,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

285
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

286
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

287
00:14:56,150 --> 00:14:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still have work to discuss
with Manager Zhou.</font>

288
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come find me when you're done.</font>

289
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:05,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take your time.</font>

290
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

291
00:15:14,670 --> 00:15:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li, she was just joking.</font>

292
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:19,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was deliberately using me
to upset you.</font>

293
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in Chunjiang</font>

294
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with this job,</font>

295
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'm very content.</font>

296
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm especially grateful
to you and Tianbao</font>

297
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for your help.</font>

298
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to keep this job.</font>

299
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:32,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me.</font>

300
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I warned you.</font>

301
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

302
00:15:37,550 --> 00:15:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember.</font>

303
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me.</font>

304
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you keep your word.</font>

305
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, did you enjoy your meal?</font>

306
00:15:49,750 --> 00:15:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should today's bill be charged
to your account</font>

307
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or to Miss Lin's account?</font>

308
00:15:53,030 --> 00:15:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager,</font>

309
00:15:53,530 --> 00:15:54,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Um,</font>

310
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just pay the bill.</font>

311
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:20,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, sir.</font>

312
00:16:20,390 --> 00:16:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is today's bill.</font>

313
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

314
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you be paying by card or cash?</font>

315
00:16:24,790 --> 00:16:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pay cash.</font>

316
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

317
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much is it?</font>

318
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:29,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The total is 30,536.</font>

319
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much did you just say?</font>

320
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">30,536.</font>

321
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How was this calculated?</font>

322
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please check the bill.
It has all the details.</font>

323
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:48,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's this 30,000 for?</font>

324
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The 30,000 is for this wine.</font>

325
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager, let me eat first.</font>

326
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll call you later.</font>

327
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, call me if you need anything.</font>

328
00:16:58,750 --> 00:16:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enjoy your meal.</font>

329
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've paid the bill.</font>

330
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

331
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:56,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pay you back in installments asap.</font>

332
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still have 100,000 yuan with me.</font>

333
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I look at you now,</font>

334
00:18:05,550 --> 00:18:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's like seeing myself.</font>

335
00:18:08,110 --> 00:18:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, my mom</font>

336
00:18:10,030 --> 00:18:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had something here.</font>

337
00:18:11,790 --> 00:18:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The doctor said surgery
would cost 10,000 yuan.</font>

338
00:18:14,550 --> 00:18:15,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At that time, my pocket</font>

339
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">held only 60 yuan.</font>

340
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom told me,</font>

341
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"It's okay."</font>

342
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Life and death are fated."</font>

343
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Let's go home."</font>

344
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I heard those words back then,</font>

345
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was completely helpless,</font>

346
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just like you are now.</font>

347
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From that day on,</font>

348
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told myself</font>

349
00:18:42,550 --> 00:18:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that, in life,</font>

350
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's only one friend: money.</font>

351
00:18:50,030 --> 00:18:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let myself stay poor.</font>

352
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can see Ruyi</font>

353
00:19:10,350 --> 00:19:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really likes you.</font>

354
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro,</font>

355
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">rising through a woman</font>

356
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is nothing to be ashamed of.</font>

357
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Tianbao.</font>

358
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink it slowly.</font>

359
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very expensive.</font>

360
00:19:36,030 --> 00:19:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm better off than you were back then.</font>

361
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then you only had 60-odd yuan.</font>

362
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have over 600 yuan.</font>

363
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been waiting here for me?</font>

364
00:20:04,790 --> 00:20:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's something I want
to report to you privately.</font>

365
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Meeting first. Aren't you attending too?</font>

366
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After the meeting, come to my office.</font>

367
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

368
00:20:12,550 --> 00:20:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao.</font>

369
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want
to investigate Dongle anymore.</font>

370
00:20:18,350 --> 00:20:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

371
00:20:19,590 --> 00:20:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you the one
who came to me before?</font>

372
00:20:22,510 --> 00:20:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, the investigation
is over for me.</font>

373
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director, forgive me.</font>

374
00:20:25,550 --> 00:20:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've let you down.</font>

375
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're about to be late.</font>

376
00:20:30,350 --> 00:20:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll talk after the meeting.</font>

377
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

378
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All departments have submitted</font>

379
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the personnel list
for the national and local tax split.</font>

380
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Starting today,</font>

381
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the national and local tax split</font>

382
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">officially enters</font>

383
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the substantive launch phase.</font>

384
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I've gathered everyone here today</font>

385
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to hold a family-splitting meeting.</font>

386
00:20:45,790 --> 00:20:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been together day and night,</font>

387
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shared joys and hardships,</font>

388
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fought side by side.</font>

389
00:20:49,070 --> 00:20:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all these years
as brothers and sisters,</font>

390
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're about to be separated.</font>

391
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone must be feeling upset.</font>

392
00:20:55,270 --> 00:20:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel the same as all of you.</font>

393
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We usually eat at the same stove</font>

394
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and work in the same office.</font>

395
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:02,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are bound
to be bumps and friction.</font>

396
00:21:03,110 --> 00:21:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now,</font>

397
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">aren't you thinking
of each other's good sides?</font>

398
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does this show?</font>

399
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It shows the family can be split,</font>

400
00:21:09,790 --> 00:21:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but our hearts</font>

401
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:12,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can never be separated.</font>

402
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are public servants.</font>

403
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just talking about unity isn't enough.</font>

404
00:21:17,750 --> 00:21:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You also need the bigger picture.</font>

405
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You also need to think long-term.</font>

406
00:21:21,030 --> 00:21:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our tax system is
under vertical management.</font>

407
00:21:23,750 --> 00:21:25,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what thoughts you have,</font>

408
00:21:25,750 --> 00:21:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must obey
the organization's arrangements.</font>

409
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, today,</font>

410
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've gathered everyone here</font>

411
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have a heart-to-heart chat</font>

412
00:21:33,110 --> 00:21:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with all of you.</font>

413
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a moment,</font>

414
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll also invite Chief Zhang</font>

415
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to say a few words.</font>

416
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You announce first.</font>

417
00:21:38,550 --> 00:21:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk after the announcement.</font>

418
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

419
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang, explain it to everyone.</font>

420
00:21:44,030 --> 00:21:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao.</font>

421
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao,</font>

422
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we came here today</font>

423
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to ask Comrade Zhang Haiyuan</font>

424
00:21:55,030 --> 00:21:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to come back with us</font>

425
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to assist the investigation.</font>

426
00:22:16,830 --> 00:22:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me. On what grounds...?</font>

427
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, Master.</font>

428
00:22:21,070 --> 00:22:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit. Everyone, sit down.</font>

429
00:22:25,550 --> 00:22:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

430
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:30,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

431
00:22:38,510 --> 00:22:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang,</font>

432
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't you propose</font>

433
00:22:41,030 --> 00:22:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the public security department</font>

434
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to investigate Dongle
from the angle of land taxation?</font>

435
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, that's right.</font>

436
00:22:48,830 --> 00:22:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But to be precise,</font>

437
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's an investigation</font>

438
00:22:52,310 --> 00:22:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into land-use nature and taxation.</font>

439
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, regarding land-use nature,</font>

440
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do they have any problems?</font>

441
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We checked. No problems.</font>

442
00:23:01,790 --> 00:23:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, before the investigation,</font>

443
00:23:02,750 --> 00:23:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you already know
they had no problems?</font>

444
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If so,</font>

445
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why did you still propose</font>

446
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to investigate from this angle?</font>

447
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was it intentional?</font>

448
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now, the city bureau</font>

449
00:23:13,790 --> 00:23:16,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">takes this HK (China)-related
gang shootout case</font>

450
00:23:16,310 --> 00:23:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">very seriously.</font>

451
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We invited
you two tax officers here today</font>

452
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because we hope that your bureau</font>

453
00:23:22,030 --> 00:23:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can enter the investigation early</font>

454
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and put up a smokescreen for them.</font>

455
00:23:25,590 --> 00:23:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should ask the police about this,</font>

456
00:23:27,110 --> 00:23:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not me.</font>

457
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only have two years until retirement.</font>

458
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You took me away
from the bureau-wide meeting</font>

459
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right when the national</font>

460
00:23:34,030 --> 00:23:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and local taxes are being split.</font>

461
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

462
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't avoid my question.</font>

463
00:23:39,680 --> 00:23:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have
any financial dealings with Dongle?</font>

464
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me put it this way.</font>

465
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle Manor officially opened</font>

466
00:23:48,790 --> 00:23:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for business in 1987.</font>

467
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was the first
HK (China)-invested enterprise</font>

468
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in our city.</font>

469
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leaders at every level
have attached great importance to it.</font>

470
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's widely said that photos
of provincial and municipal leaders</font>

471
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on inspection visits still hang</font>

472
00:23:59,880 --> 00:24:02,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Dongle Manor's VIP room.</font>

473
00:24:02,310 --> 00:24:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you worried about the impact,</font>

474
00:24:04,830 --> 00:24:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or are you afraid of resistance?</font>

475
00:24:06,030 --> 00:24:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both.</font>

476
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:08,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think this is</font>

477
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our first time investigating Dongle?</font>

478
00:24:10,310 --> 00:24:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu from your Inspection Unit</font>

479
00:24:13,350 --> 00:24:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once reported to you</font>

480
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:17,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Dongle was suspected
of tax evasion.</font>

481
00:24:17,030 --> 00:24:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you ordered him</font>

482
00:24:18,750 --> 00:24:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stop the investigation</font>

483
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and suspend him from duty.</font>

484
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is that?</font>

485
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was he the one who reported me?</font>

486
00:24:28,830 --> 00:24:30,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't avoid my question.</font>

487
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

488
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:36,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I treated you as a friend.</font>

489
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said those words in private,</font>

490
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you reported them!</font>

491
00:24:41,550 --> 00:24:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything related to my case</font>

492
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has to be reported.</font>

493
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's my master!</font>

494
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If your master had a problem,</font>

495
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should we just not investigate?</font>

496
00:24:48,830 --> 00:24:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know that a single check by you</font>

497
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could have a huge impact on him?</font>

498
00:24:51,550 --> 00:24:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is the impact on him more important,</font>

499
00:24:53,110 --> 00:24:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or is it more important
if he has a problem?</font>

500
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:55,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

501
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough, enough.</font>

502
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:58,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this what a friend should do?</font>

503
00:24:58,350 --> 00:24:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The closer we are,
the more I should investigate.</font>

504
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sooner it's cleared up,</font>

505
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the better it is for your master
and for you.</font>

506
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Du.</font>

507
00:25:08,790 --> 00:25:09,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you cooled down?</font>

508
00:25:09,640 --> 00:25:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not, hit me two more times.</font>

509
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come to my office in a bit.</font>

510
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some chrysanthemum tea to cool off.</font>

511
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay, bro?</font>

512
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

513
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Find the man with the severed thumb
from the shootout asap.</font>

514
00:25:22,790 --> 00:25:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

515
00:25:23,350 --> 00:25:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to see for myself</font>

516
00:25:24,510 --> 00:25:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just how deep the waters
of Dongle really run.</font>

517
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Fang,</font>

518
00:26:03,790 --> 00:26:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's Zhao Jinming.</font>

519
00:26:05,240 --> 00:26:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's something</font>

520
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been thinking about for days,</font>

521
00:26:07,550 --> 00:26:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I still need to report it to you.</font>

522
00:26:10,350 --> 00:26:12,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's about Comrade Zhang Haiyuan</font>

523
00:26:12,310 --> 00:26:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of our bureau's Inspection Unit.</font>

524
00:26:22,550 --> 00:26:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang,</font>

525
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard you got the imperial sword</font>

526
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to carry out a special mission.</font>

527
00:26:27,830 --> 00:26:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a hint.</font>

528
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jia Shijie, are you done
checking those invoices?</font>

529
00:26:38,750 --> 00:26:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xu,</font>

530
00:26:40,550 --> 00:26:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter what happens,
you have my trust.</font>

531
00:26:46,110 --> 00:26:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Yawen.</font>

532
00:27:02,510 --> 00:27:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Zhou,</font>

533
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell me the truth.</font>

534
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has Master been having you
investigate Dongle all along?</font>

535
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:13,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you blame me, I won't explain.</font>

536
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you really know something,</font>

537
00:27:14,310 --> 00:27:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell me.</font>

538
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe we can help Master.</font>

539
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master doesn't need help.</font>

540
00:27:18,440 --> 00:27:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe Master will be fine.</font>

541
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also believe</font>

542
00:27:20,790 --> 00:27:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the higher-ups will prove
Master is innocent.</font>

543
00:27:23,350 --> 00:27:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu, we know better than anyone</font>

544
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what kind of person Master is.</font>

545
00:27:27,750 --> 00:27:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether we trust him</font>

546
00:27:29,310 --> 00:27:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">matters more than anything now.</font>

547
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? I told you.</font>

548
00:27:43,510 --> 00:27:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Another dead end.</font>

549
00:27:45,270 --> 00:27:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This guy with the severed thumb</font>

550
00:27:46,270 --> 00:27:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">probably never came
to a hospital at all.</font>

551
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't think like that.</font>

552
00:27:48,960 --> 00:27:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our line of work as CID officers,</font>

553
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nine in ten leads go nowhere.</font>

554
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't get ahead of yourself.</font>

555
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. Next one.</font>

556
00:27:55,920 --> 00:27:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang People's Hospital]</font>

557
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

558
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

559
00:28:03,030 --> 00:28:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

560
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

561
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

562
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

563
00:28:08,030 --> 00:28:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Erfang.</font>

564
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you sitting here?</font>

565
00:28:10,270 --> 00:28:12,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you get here? Where's Biao?</font>

566
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just arrived today.</font>

567
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Biao said he was hungry.</font>

568
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I went to get him something to eat.</font>

569
00:28:20,110 --> 00:28:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy. Slow down.</font>

570
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then?</font>

571
00:28:21,880 --> 00:28:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I came back,</font>

572
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw the police taking him away.</font>

573
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did the police take him?</font>

574
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know either.</font>

575
00:28:29,790 --> 00:28:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police asked me</font>

576
00:28:30,550 --> 00:28:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I knew anyone in Chunjiang.</font>

577
00:28:33,110 --> 00:28:35,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I gave them the number you left.</font>

578
00:28:35,310 --> 00:28:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, don't worry, Erfang.</font>

579
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait here for me.</font>

580
00:28:37,920 --> 00:28:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go in and find out what's going on.</font>

581
00:28:42,550 --> 00:28:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, you have to save Biao.</font>

582
00:28:52,350 --> 00:28:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything else to add?</font>

583
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, officer.</font>

584
00:28:54,350 --> 00:28:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is the person who was arrested
at the dock just now?</font>

585
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:56,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know?</font>

586
00:28:56,750 --> 00:28:57,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go check over there.</font>

587
00:28:58,590 --> 00:28:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thanks.</font>

588
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Biao.</font>

589
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, it wasn't me.</font>

590
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I got off the boat, they grabbed me</font>

591
00:29:12,590 --> 00:29:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and forced me to buy them.</font>

592
00:29:13,720 --> 00:29:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't buy fake invoices.</font>

593
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

594
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Nonsense.
Don't try anything.</font>

595
00:29:18,110 --> 00:29:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're his</font>

596
00:29:19,030 --> 00:29:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">relative in Chunjiang City, right?</font>

597
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

598
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer.</font>

599
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This relative of mine</font>

600
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been honest since he was little.</font>

601
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:28,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't even finish elementary school.</font>

602
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He probably doesn't even know
what an invoice is.</font>

603
00:29:31,030 --> 00:29:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about...</font>

604
00:29:32,310 --> 00:29:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll investigate
whether he knows or not.</font>

605
00:29:34,310 --> 00:29:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go wait outside first.</font>

606
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, here, have a cigarette.</font>

607
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please go wait outside.</font>

608
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

609
00:30:02,070 --> 00:30:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to trouble you.</font>

610
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:03,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

611
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't see you off.</font>

612
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, goodbye.</font>

613
00:30:06,510 --> 00:30:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an, thank you.</font>

614
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My fellow townsman
doesn't know any better.</font>

615
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up and thank Officer Yan.</font>

616
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a warning for you.</font>

617
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can be big or small.</font>

618
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:19,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know it in your heart.</font>

619
00:30:19,790 --> 00:30:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood, understood.</font>

620
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, no meal for me.</font>

621
00:30:23,270 --> 00:30:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll head out first.
I have things to do.</font>

622
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sorry for the trouble.
- Thank you.</font>

623
00:30:25,350 --> 00:30:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye.</font>

624
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you hungry?</font>

625
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go get the stuff.</font>

626
00:30:43,750 --> 00:30:44,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

627
00:30:47,110 --> 00:30:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, go.</font>

628
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:48,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go, let's go.</font>

629
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fuhao Club]</font>

630
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you finish all that?</font>

631
00:30:57,310 --> 00:30:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a lot more cake over there.</font>

632
00:30:58,720 --> 00:30:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we eat those too?</font>

633
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:01,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take only as much as you can eat.</font>

634
00:31:01,830 --> 00:31:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't leave any.</font>

635
00:31:02,830 --> 00:31:03,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

636
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't leave any.</font>

637
00:31:08,550 --> 00:31:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get some of this.</font>

638
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

639
00:31:22,550 --> 00:31:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you getting anything?</font>

640
00:31:24,070 --> 00:31:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not hungry yet.</font>

641
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Erfang, go get me a cup of tea.</font>

642
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay, bro.</font>

643
00:31:32,110 --> 00:31:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, get me one too.</font>

644
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

645
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was wrong with you just now?</font>

646
00:31:41,350 --> 00:31:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm asking you.</font>

647
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was that fake invoice about?</font>

648
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, didn't I just tell you?</font>

649
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to ask for directions.</font>

650
00:31:48,030 --> 00:31:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They forced me to buy the invoice.</font>

651
00:31:55,750 --> 00:31:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

652
00:31:57,790 --> 00:31:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This thing is so precious back home.</font>

653
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to make some quick money.</font>

654
00:32:01,590 --> 00:32:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't expect the police
to catch me red-handed.</font>

655
00:32:03,830 --> 00:32:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Luckily, you have connections.</font>

656
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're asking for trouble.</font>

657
00:32:06,750 --> 00:32:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This will drag my friend from earlier</font>

658
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into trouble too, you know?</font>

659
00:32:09,790 --> 00:32:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you.</font>

660
00:32:11,110 --> 00:32:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, in Chunjiang,</font>

661
00:32:12,270 --> 00:32:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't do this kind of shady stuff again.</font>

662
00:32:17,350 --> 00:32:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro.</font>

663
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no choice.</font>

664
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone told me</font>

665
00:32:21,200 --> 00:32:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Chunjiang is full of money.</font>

666
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here to earn more money.</font>

667
00:32:24,680 --> 00:32:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to be like you.</font>

668
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

669
00:32:26,550 --> 00:32:28,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, Haiyang.</font>

670
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Erfang.</font>

671
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While you're in Chunjiang,</font>

672
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">help me keep an eye on him.</font>

673
00:32:36,640 --> 00:32:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let it be like back home.</font>

674
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't forget</font>

675
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I told you.</font>

676
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since we came here,</font>

677
00:32:42,030 --> 00:32:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we have to listen to Haiyang.</font>

678
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the only reason I agreed
to come here with you.</font>

679
00:32:54,680 --> 00:32:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, my mistake.</font>

680
00:32:56,920 --> 00:32:58,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know I was wrong.</font>

681
00:32:58,440 --> 00:32:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll listen to you.</font>

682
00:32:59,350 --> 00:33:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I listened to you as a kid.</font>

683
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still listen to you now.</font>

684
00:33:01,830 --> 00:33:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong.</font>

685
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, don't be mad.</font>

686
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll both listen to you.</font>

687
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:07,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you.</font>

688
00:33:07,270 --> 00:33:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Struggling alone
in Chunjiang isn't easy.</font>

689
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that the two of us are here,</font>

690
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're your family.</font>

691
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, whatever you say goes.</font>

692
00:33:14,590 --> 00:33:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

693
00:33:18,790 --> 00:33:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a place like Chunjiang,</font>

694
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">learning how to treat people
matters more than getting things done.</font>

695
00:33:24,920 --> 00:33:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Erfang.</font>

696
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

697
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No drinks for him.</font>

698
00:33:35,030 --> 00:33:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome to Chunjiang.</font>

699
00:33:36,680 --> 00:33:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Haiyang.</font>

700
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:45,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, bro.</font>

701
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up.</font>

702
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Erfang,</font>

703
00:33:56,550 --> 00:33:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the first time I had a buffet,</font>

704
00:33:59,030 --> 00:34:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I took even more food than you two.</font>

705
00:34:01,400 --> 00:34:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I started with two big steamed buns.</font>

706
00:34:04,480 --> 00:34:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me teach you how to do a buffet.</font>

707
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How?</font>

708
00:34:07,590 --> 00:34:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Skip the sweet potatoes and buns.</font>

709
00:34:10,070 --> 00:34:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're going to eat, eat shrimp.</font>

710
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:12,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat seafood.</font>

711
00:34:12,670 --> 00:34:13,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

712
00:34:13,150 --> 00:34:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seafood is expensive.</font>

713
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat shrimp.</font>

714
00:34:15,190 --> 00:34:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat more.
I've been eating shrimp the whole time.</font>

715
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:18,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's more here.</font>

716
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way, Haiyang,</font>

717
00:34:21,590 --> 00:34:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you found your wife?</font>

718
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No news yet.</font>

719
00:34:30,070 --> 00:34:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard from a coworker</font>

720
00:34:32,070 --> 00:34:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at her old factory</font>

721
00:34:33,070 --> 00:34:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that there was a HK (China) recruitment.</font>

722
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:36,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems like she went there.</font>

723
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Biao,</font>

724
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you have time in Chunjiang,
help me ask around.</font>

725
00:34:41,590 --> 00:34:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, got it.</font>

726
00:34:44,590 --> 00:34:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If only I had money.</font>

727
00:34:50,110 --> 00:34:51,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, where are you from?</font>

728
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:56,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm from your heart.</font>

729
00:34:57,070 --> 00:34:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop it.</font>

730
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:02,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, what happened to your hand?</font>

731
00:35:02,550 --> 00:35:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got hurt at work.</font>

732
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:04,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you believe me?</font>

733
00:35:05,150 --> 00:35:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe you.</font>

734
00:35:06,440 --> 00:35:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It looks pretty serious.</font>

735
00:35:08,590 --> 00:35:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not serious.</font>

736
00:35:09,710 --> 00:35:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't stop me from doing anything.</font>

737
00:35:20,230 --> 00:35:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, wait for me a moment.</font>

738
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go get you a bottle</font>

739
00:35:22,920 --> 00:35:24,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of better shampoo, okay?</font>

740
00:35:24,960 --> 00:35:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why fail me at the key moment?</font>

741
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wait for me.</font>

742
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

743
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:40,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our homemade honey.</font>

744
00:35:40,670 --> 00:35:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom knows you love peanuts.</font>

745
00:35:42,230 --> 00:35:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I pressed this oil myself.</font>

746
00:35:43,150 --> 00:35:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why bring all this?
The city has everything.</font>

747
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- And fish.
- You can buy it all.</font>

748
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And our sweet potatoes.</font>

749
00:35:47,150 --> 00:35:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are your favorites.</font>

750
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From our own field.</font>

751
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really don't mind the weight.</font>

752
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

753
00:35:51,710 --> 00:35:52,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

754
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

755
00:35:55,030 --> 00:35:55,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Biao.</font>

756
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you suddenly come?</font>

757
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:59,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, I want to marry Erfang.</font>

758
00:36:00,030 --> 00:36:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her dad doesn't agree.</font>

759
00:36:01,280 --> 00:36:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got angry...</font>

760
00:36:02,920 --> 00:36:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were her dad,
I wouldn't agree either.</font>

761
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just learned
some martial arts as a kid.</font>

762
00:36:06,550 --> 00:36:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else can you do?</font>

763
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you're already here,</font>

764
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stay at my place for now.</font>

765
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, bro.</font>

766
00:36:12,590 --> 00:36:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, then where will you stay?</font>

767
00:36:14,760 --> 00:36:16,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I first got here,</font>

768
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even slept under a bridge.</font>

769
00:36:17,630 --> 00:36:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sleeping anywhere is still sleeping.</font>

770
00:36:18,630 --> 00:36:19,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about me.</font>

771
00:36:19,480 --> 00:36:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Clean up. Go to sleep.</font>

772
00:36:20,550 --> 00:36:21,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

773
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put this here first.</font>

774
00:36:23,030 --> 00:36:24,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let me do it.</font>

775
00:36:24,150 --> 00:36:25,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, you should rest early.</font>

776
00:36:29,190 --> 00:36:29,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

777
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relatives from my hometown.</font>

778
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xing has shown up.</font>

779
00:36:39,710 --> 00:36:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going out for a bit.</font>

780
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Page three times. Guangyi Hair Salon.</font>

781
00:37:01,070 --> 00:37:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you change your pants?</font>

782
00:37:07,110 --> 00:37:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you have a beard now?</font>

783
00:37:10,190 --> 00:37:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me shave it for you.</font>

784
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

785
00:37:14,840 --> 00:37:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The knife is dangerous.</font>

786
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Last time, one thumb</font>

787
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cost the lives
of several of my brothers.</font>

788
00:37:22,070 --> 00:37:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really lost out.</font>

789
00:37:24,510 --> 00:37:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xing, have I not been
good to you?</font>

790
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

791
00:37:58,230 --> 00:37:59,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you betray me?</font>

792
00:38:02,190 --> 00:38:03,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't have money to buy powder.</font>

793
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone gave me money.</font>

794
00:38:05,190 --> 00:38:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

795
00:38:06,230 --> 00:38:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

796
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I met him at the disco.</font>

797
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has a mole on his face.</font>

798
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many people have moles
on their faces.</font>

799
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you messing with me?</font>

800
00:38:16,710 --> 00:38:17,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

801
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:19,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard him on the phone.</font>

802
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He called someone.</font>

803
00:38:20,510 --> 00:38:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was on the phone.</font>

804
00:38:21,400 --> 00:38:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who did he call?</font>

805
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

806
00:38:24,110 --> 00:38:27,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, I heard him call Ahong.</font>

807
00:38:36,510 --> 00:38:38,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, come play with us.</font>

808
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come play.</font>

809
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:40,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

810
00:38:50,030 --> 00:38:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

811
00:38:55,360 --> 00:38:56,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you staying at home?</font>

812
00:38:56,230 --> 00:38:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

813
00:38:57,030 --> 00:38:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to help you.</font>

814
00:38:58,070 --> 00:38:59,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't need your help. Go back now.</font>

815
00:38:59,150 --> 00:39:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cop who got me out tonight</font>

816
00:39:00,510 --> 00:39:01,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even came here to help you.</font>

817
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't I?</font>

818
00:39:03,190 --> 00:39:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did you see that cop?</font>

819
00:39:04,840 --> 00:39:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right at that intersection.</font>

820
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's coming over right now.</font>

821
00:39:10,550 --> 00:39:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not good. Go!</font>

822
00:39:12,590 --> 00:39:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, the cops are here!</font>

823
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

824
00:39:21,070 --> 00:39:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahua, Ahua.</font>

825
00:39:22,070 --> 00:39:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

826
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:23,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, listen to me.</font>

827
00:39:23,710 --> 00:39:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's more than one cop.</font>

828
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

829
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:30,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Open up!
- Freeze!</font>

830
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:32,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Freeze!</font>

831
00:39:32,630 --> 00:39:33,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open up!</font>

832
00:39:50,110 --> 00:39:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are they?</font>

833
00:39:51,150 --> 00:39:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out back! Out back!</font>

834
00:40:01,920 --> 00:40:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

835
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you let me act just now?</font>

836
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could we act, Ahua?</font>

837
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There were so many cops just now.</font>

838
00:40:07,510 --> 00:40:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we'd fought, we'd have lost.</font>

839
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:14,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were afraid Ahua
would kill Yan Ping'an, right?</font>

840
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you not to stand on both sides.</font>

841
00:40:18,230 --> 00:40:18,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, Tianbao.</font>

842
00:40:19,840 --> 00:40:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if it were not Yan Ping'an,</font>

843
00:40:22,000 --> 00:40:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if it were another cop,</font>

844
00:40:23,030 --> 00:40:24,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we still couldn't have acted.</font>

845
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Killing a cop on the mainland
is a huge crime.</font>

846
00:40:26,670 --> 00:40:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wouldn't get away with it.</font>

847
00:40:29,190 --> 00:40:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, my brother's right.
Killing a cop...</font>

848
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I ask you?</font>

849
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:33,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I?</font>

850
00:40:33,710 --> 00:40:34,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, Tianbao.</font>

851
00:40:35,590 --> 00:40:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop talking.</font>

852
00:40:37,150 --> 00:40:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just came to help out of kindness.</font>

853
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if he would betray you,</font>

854
00:40:42,190 --> 00:40:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he would never betray me.</font>

855
00:40:43,760 --> 00:40:44,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust him.</font>

856
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:47,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to butt in?</font>

857
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We went to find Xing.</font>

858
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:51,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did the police know?</font>

859
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

860
00:40:57,550 --> 00:40:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

861
00:40:59,630 --> 00:41:00,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

862
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Luis.</font>

863
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already safely</font>

864
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">transferred your money</font>

865
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your overseas account.</font>

866
00:41:19,400 --> 00:41:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're welcome.</font>

867
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

868
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao found Xing.</font>

869
00:41:33,030 --> 00:41:33,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is he?</font>

870
00:41:34,280 --> 00:41:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xing was taken away by the police.</font>

871
00:41:36,190 --> 00:41:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao ran off.</font>

872
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, shouldn't we</font>

873
00:41:38,710 --> 00:41:41,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make some plans in advance?</font>

874
00:41:47,760 --> 00:41:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who taught you that?</font>

875
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I tell you to go?</font>

876
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to stay home and rest.</font>

877
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find you a job.</font>

878
00:41:53,710 --> 00:41:55,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you even know who they are?</font>

879
00:41:55,800 --> 00:41:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're playing your little tricks on me?</font>

880
00:41:58,510 --> 00:42:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I hadn't protected you today,</font>

881
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they would have shot you already.</font>

882
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think this is your hometown?</font>

883
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Chunjiang.</font>

884
00:42:05,110 --> 00:42:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A place where you risk your life
for a future.</font>

885
00:42:09,230 --> 00:42:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think everyone is a friend.</font>

886
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:12,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You treat them as friends.</font>

887
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:14,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will they treat you like family?</font>

888
00:42:14,550 --> 00:42:15,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, they won't!</font>

889
00:42:16,590 --> 00:42:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't stay in Chunjiang.</font>

890
00:42:17,670 --> 00:42:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow morning,
I'll buy you a train ticket.</font>

891
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Erfang</font>

892
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and go back home.</font>

893
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear me?</font>

894
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All you do is cause trouble.</font>

895
00:43:31,150 --> 00:43:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Why do you need to hide♪</font>

896
00:43:33,270 --> 00:43:34,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪So♪</font>

897
00:43:35,240 --> 00:43:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Ordinary and simple♪</font>

898
00:43:38,270 --> 00:43:42,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I dare not look back on those days♪</font>

899
00:43:42,350 --> 00:43:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Clinging to broken wholeness♪</font>

900
00:43:45,970 --> 00:43:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The strength of worrying
about gain and loss♪</font>

901
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking means courage♪</font>

902
00:43:52,640 --> 00:43:56,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The ambitious young man♪</font>

903
00:43:56,650 --> 00:43:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Accompanied by loneliness♪</font>

904
00:43:59,550 --> 00:44:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking through the tracks of time♪</font>

905
00:44:03,180 --> 00:44:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The remnants of dreams are uproaring♪</font>

906
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:10,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At my lowest moments, I always look up♪</font>

907
00:44:10,980 --> 00:44:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging♪</font>

908
00:44:14,520 --> 00:44:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

909
00:44:21,330 --> 00:44:25,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

910
00:44:25,230 --> 00:44:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

911
00:44:27,930 --> 00:44:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

912
00:44:31,110 --> 00:44:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Take off all the armor♪</font>

913
00:44:35,570 --> 00:44:37,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

914
00:44:37,460 --> 00:44:39,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

915
00:44:39,310 --> 00:44:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging for mercy
in humiliation♪</font>

916
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:49,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

917
00:44:49,900 --> 00:44:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

918
00:44:53,940 --> 00:44:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

919
00:44:56,620 --> 00:44:59,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

920
00:44:59,780 --> 00:45:02,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Even if I fall again♪</font>

921
00:45:03,870 --> 00:45:05,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

922
00:45:05,630 --> 00:45:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

923
00:45:07,440 --> 00:45:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging anyone for mercy♪</font>
